@using Shopfolio.Modules.Catalog.Contracts.Pricing
@model OriginLabel
@* The one component that draws the domestic production logo (T501; 02 3.8.5; 04 5.4.4, 5.4.18): the origin line of the price block - the country's name is written with the logo and without it -
   and, when the product is a physical one made in Turkey, the Ministry's logo beside it. No class of the width hides it, no setting or panel field closes it (K-610). The price block calls this component. *@
<p class="origin-label">
    <span class="origin-label__text">Üretim yeri: @Model.CountryName</span>
    @if (Model.ShowsLogo)
    {
        <img class="origin-label__logo" src="@DomesticProductionLogo.Address" alt="Yerli üretim logosu" width="120" height="52">
    }
</p>
